    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.43.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Content:{/color} you can now invite {image=icon_wnei} out to the {b}Shopping{/b}, where she explores a bookstore and a fashion store her own curious way, gets help picking her swimsuit, and enjoy a happy end for both of you! 🗿🍷 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Content Progress:{/color} the content list on Character Menu now checks by itself what you've already done, and lists more content: {image=icon_wsis}'s horror movie, sleep together, first kiss and bath time, {image=icon_wmom}'s family meeting and backache, and the Student Council's daily shower quest {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Custom Start:{/color} the checkpoint configuration now shows every content from the Content Progress list, including {image=icon_wcou}'s; {image=icon_wsuk}'s and the P.E Teacher's, and stays up to date with every new content {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Courtyard Table:{/color} joining someone at a courtyard table now shows the reworked system of the panorama camera and messages about characters you see as you drag the screen or panorama bar {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} {image=icon_wsuk}'s first meeting dialogue now plays, and her content is now marked as done {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} the guide of {b}A New Journey{/b} now asks for the right number of unlocked classmates, and the bath with {image=icon_wsis} no longer shows the wrong name {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} joining someone eating at a courtyard table no longer crashes the game with infinite loop {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} closing the guide opened by the {b}guide{/b} code now works, instead of leaving it stuck on screen {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} {image=icon_wsis} now waits for you at school until 12:59 before going home, so {b}Go home together{/b} can be done at the time its guide shows"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.43.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新增内容：{/color} 现在可以邀请 {image=icon_wnei} 前往 {b}购物中心{/b}，陪她以自己独特的方式探索书店和服装店，帮她挑泳衣，再一起迎来快乐的结尾！🗿🍷 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 内容进度：{/color} 角色菜单的内容列表现在会自动检查已完成项目，并新增了以下内容： {image=icon_wsis}的恐怖电影、同床共眠、初吻与共浴， {image=icon_wmom}的家庭会议、腰痛事件，以及学生会的每日淋浴任务 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 自定义开局：{/color} 检查点设置现在会显示内容进度列表中的全部内容，包括 {image=icon_wcou}的内容； {image=icon_wsuk}和体育老师的内容，并会随新内容持续更新 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 庭院餐桌：{/color} 加入庭院餐桌时，会使用改进后的全景镜头；拖动画面或全景条时，会提示你看到了哪些角色 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} {image=icon_wsuk}的初遇对话现在能正常播放，对应内容也会正确标记为已完成 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 任务指引 {b}新的旅程{/b} 现在会要求正确数量的已解锁同学；与 {image=icon_wsis} 共浴时也不会再显示错误的名字 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 加入在庭院餐桌吃饭的角色，不会再因无限循环导致游戏崩溃 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 使用 {b}guide{/b} 代码打开的指引现在可以正常关闭，不会再卡在屏幕上 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} {image=icon_wsis} 现在会在学校等你到12:59才回家，因此 {b}一起回家{/b} 可以在指引显示的时间完成"

