    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.42.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Devlog:{/color} added devlogs from previous updates {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Hentai:{/color} added hentai animations to {image=icon_wsis}; {image=icon_wmom}; {image=icon_wgal} and {image=icon_wota}, with a special dynamic sex animation for {image=icon_wsis} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Character Database:{/color} more detailed info of character stats are now available on Character Menu. Check how fast stat points grow with different types of bonus and variables. Click on the icon of {b}Intelligence{/b}, {b}Charisma{/b} or {b}Physics{/b} to unfold its three sub-stats, and with cheats on you can drag those too {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Laundry:{/color} you can now toss the clothes you are wearing into the basket and wander the house in your underwear or a towel until they are back, the housemates have something to say about it. {image=icon_wmom} may wash your clothes along with hers on her wash day {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Animation:{/color} opening the wrong stall in the female locker room may now catch {image=icon_wgal} or {image=icon_wota} relieving herself, before she notices you are there {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} MoCha2D:{/color} improved the tool for creating animated rigged/morphed characters, MoCha2D, the tool of Modular 2D Character creation, leaving folder better organized; optimized animation; and better meshes reactions to physics simulation. {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translator:{/color} holding {b}CTRL{/b} while you press the arrows now walks the cursor one whole word or one whole tag at a time, instead of stopping in the middle of a tag {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Error Screen:{/color} added an art on Ren'Py error screen to leave it a little cute. Hope it doesn't have error, but if it does, at least it'll have an art :D {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} clothes cleanliness could never reach 100% because outfits nobody owned kept counting as dirty forever {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} {image=icon_wmom} now goes to sleep at her bedtime, instead of staying up until midnight\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.42.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} after first kiss with {image=icon_wsis}, it was changing the wrong variable, now it correctly progresses her content {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} no more infinite loop when you see {image=icon_wsis} changing after bath time {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} replaced old images of icons and splash arts to the updated ones for android building. It seems to be the same problem of previous bug fix, where I must have replaced a fixed file with an older version at some moment xD"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.42.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 开发日志：{/color} 补充了以前版本的更新日志 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 成人动画：{/color} 为以下角色加入了成人动画： {image=icon_wsis}; {image=icon_wmom}; {image=icon_wgal} 和 {image=icon_wota}，还为以下角色加入了特别的动态性爱动画： {image=icon_wsis} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 角色资料库：{/color} 角色菜单现在能查看更详细的属性资料，包括各类加成和变量对成长速度的影响。点击 {b}智力{/b}, {b}魅力{/b} 或 {b}体能{/b} 图标，可展开三个子属性；开启作弊后，也能拖动调整它们 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 洗衣：{/color} 现在可以把身上的衣服扔进衣篮，等洗好前只穿内衣或裹着浴巾在家走动，同住的人也会对此作出评论。 {image=icon_wmom} 可能会在自己的洗衣日顺便帮你洗衣服 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新动画：{/color} 在女更衣室开错隔间门，现在可能会撞见 {image=icon_wgal} 或 {image=icon_wota} 正在解手，然后她才发现你来了 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} MoCha2D：{/color} 改进了模块化二维角色创作工具MoCha2D，可用于制作骨骼／形变动画角色。整理了文件夹，优化了动画，并改善了网格对物理模拟的响应。 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译工具：{/color} 按住 {b}CTRL{/b} 再按方向键，现在会整词或整标签地移动光标，不再停在标签中间 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 错误界面：{/color} 给Ren’Py报错界面加了张插画，让它可爱一点。希望大家别遇到报错；万一报错，至少还有画看 :D {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 修复了无人持有的服装始终被算成脏衣服，导致整洁度无法达到100%的问题 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} {image=icon_wmom} 现在会按自己的就寝时间睡觉，不再一直熬到午夜\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.42.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 与 {image=icon_wsis}初吻后，不会再修改错误变量，现在能正确推进她的内容 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 观看 {image=icon_wsis} 洗澡后换衣服时，不会再陷入无限循环 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 安卓打包所用的旧图标和启动插画，已替换为新版。好像和之前修复的是同一个问题，估计我什么时候又把修好的文件换回旧版了，哈哈"

