    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.41.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translator:{/color} you can now translate the game from inside the game itself. Open it on the {b}Language{/b} menu or by pressing {b}SHIFT+T{/b} anywhere, search for any line you want, see the scene it belongs to so you know what it's about, and rewrite it with the original right below as reference. Everything you write goes straight into the translation files, ready to be sent, and you can even start a brand new language from zero. {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Date System:{/color} refined date system mechanics; interface; and dialogues with {image=icon_wsis}'s. Now, you can better chose paths of fun; romance; or spice, and also kiss {image=icon_wsis}. For that, make your romance points highest than spice and fun, and above 40%. {p}✏ {b}Food Court:{/b} there are food options that you can buy how much you can to boost your date score. {p}✏ {b}Photobooth:{/b} different reactions and even the choices on your photo affect the date score results. {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Scene:{/color} bath together with {image=icon_wsis}. For that, {image=icon_wsis} needs at least 60% lust at the end of a date, and have done the first kiss.\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.41.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translator:{/color} the writing box now works like any other text box. Click where you want the cursor, drag to select, double-click to grab a whole tag or the words between two of them, and erase a tag in one keystroke. Tags and variables are colored apart from the words so you can see at a glance what not to touch, and the preview now shows the line exactly as the game shows it, names and colors and all. Accents and symbols also type normally again. {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Cheats:{/color} infinite money and perks can now be switched back off at any time, and no longer break dates. {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bathing Animation:{/color} left an option to disable the mechanics of bathing minigame for weakest devices, leaving only simple animation."
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.41.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译工具：{/color} 现在可以直接在游戏内翻译。通过 {b}语言{/b} 菜单打开，或在任意地方按 {b}SHIFT+T{/b} ，搜索任意文本，查看对应场景以了解语境，再参考下方原文改写。写好的内容会直接保存到翻译文件，随时可以提交，也能从零新建一种语言。 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 约会系统：{/color} 优化了约会机制、界面，以及与 {image=icon_wsis}的对话。现在更方便选择欢乐、浪漫或火辣路线，也能亲吻 {image=icon_wsis}。条件是浪漫分高于火辣与欢乐分，并超过40%。 {p}✏ {b}美食广场：{/b} 可以在负担范围内购买多份食物，提升约会得分。 {p}✏ {b}大头贴：{/b} 不同反应以及照片选项，都会影响约会评分。 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新场景：{/color} 与 {image=icon_wsis}共浴。条件是： {image=icon_wsis} 在约会结束时欲望至少达到60%，并已完成初吻。\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.41.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译工具：{/color} 编辑框现在和普通文本框一样易用：点击定位光标，拖动选择，双击选中整个标签或标签之间的文字，也能一次删除完整标签。标签、变量与正文分色显示，方便识别不能改动的部分。预览会按游戏实际效果显示文本，包括名字和颜色。重音字符和符号也能正常输入了。 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 作弊：{/color} 无限金钱和天赋现在可以随时关闭，也不会再破坏约会流程。 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 洗澡动画：{/color} 加入关闭洗澡小游戏操作的选项，供性能较弱的设备使用，只保留简单动画。"

