    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.40.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Changing:{/color} before {b}P.E.{/b} and {b}Aquatics{/b} the girls may get changed in the female locker room, and if you walk in at the \"wrong\" moment, you can see them wearing whatever they happened to be putting on {p}✏ {b}Checking:{/b} step through the room in close-up before anything else happens {p}✏ {b}Explanation:{/b} apologize, or claim the {b}Student Council{/b} sent you, but if no errand actually sent you there, they will catch the lie, and it costs you Council reputation {p}✏ {b}Judgement:{/b} each girl makes up her own mind from how close you are, how much she likes you and how modest she is, then the majority decides. Watch their faces turn the moment you answer {p}✏ {b}Consequences:{/b} talk your way out and they let it go. Fail, and they take it further, banning you from female locker room for the rest of the day {p} Girls may also no longer be fully dressed while in the middle of changing, anywhere in the game {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Date System:{/color} you can now invite {image=icon_wsis} out to the {b}Shopping{/b} and spend time however you like if you have enough time and money for that, the cinema, the food court, a photo together, or trying on clothes. Both of you dress up for the occasion, and the outfits stay unlocked afterwards in the Character Menu. A small panel in the mall shows how {b}romantic{/b}, {b}fun{/b} and {b}spicy{/b} the day has been so far. Fold it away with the button in the corner if you would rather be surprised. The best you score, most points you get with her {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Photo System:{/color} at the photo stall in the Shopping Mall you can now make your own photos with {image=icon_wsis}. The photo you take is kept on your phone as a new picture, personalized as you prefere. Just choose the background color, an overlay to decorate it, {image=icon_hero}'s expression, and whether the photo is vertical or horizontal {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Dance Minigame:{/color} the dance with {image=icon_wnei} was rebuilt from scratch to actually follow the music. Arrows now travel from right to left and land on the hit line exactly {b}on the beat{/b}, instead of falling at a random pace. Every song was measured and charted to its real tempo, so the notes follow what you are hearing, and the music and the dancing now start together on the first note. The new dance now also have a different version for {b}phones{/b}: hold the device upright, the arrows fall from the top through four wide lanes, and you tap the lane to hit its arrow. {p}✏ {b}Right hit:{/b} +1 point {p}✏ {b}Perfect hit:{/b} +1 additional point for each perfect in a row {p}✏ {b}Miss or wrong arrow:{/b} -1 point for each in a row {p}✏ {b}Fair misses:{/b} a wrong or mistimed tap counts as only {b}one{/b} mistake and no longer charges you for the note it was aimed at, and phantom double-taps on touch screens are ignored {p}✏ {b}Performance perk:{/b} leveling {b}Performance{/b} widens both timing windows, making the beat easier to catch {p}It was optimized to run smoothly on weak devices, but the old dance is still there for comparison while the new one is being polished. Let me know if you found it better or didn't help anything. {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Performance Settings:{/color} a new section in {b}Settings{/b} with switches that actually matter on weak devices: hide the {b}minigame dancers{/b}, or swap the {b}animated menu scene{/b} for a still image. Phones start with the still menu for smoothness and battery — turn it back on if your device handles it. The menu art was also optimized to use a quarter of the memory, and the game download got a little smaller {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Lighter Game:{/color} the game is about {b}84 MB smaller{/b} and might run faster. Sound effects and images were re-encoded to lighter formats, and the color/lighting effects that tint backgrounds by time of day were moved to the GPU, so the game should be smoother on weaker devices {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Save Safety:{/color} old saves now pick up new rooms, maps and school data added in future updates, instead of staying stuck with the version they were created in {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} the game could crash whenever a place was shown in the late afternoon, between 16:00 and 19:00, which is exactly when a day out tends to end. Sunset lighting works on every background again\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.40.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translations:{/color} lines that had lost their translation in past updates were recovered, so they show up again in your language instead of appearing empty. Also, added new lines of Portuguese Translation. {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} minigame {b}Find{/b} was trying to get PNG format images, but it was converted to WEBP. Now it works correctly. {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} laundry chores are now correctly counting time during pass of days, so clothes will no longer get stuck infinitelly {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} the Student Council shower repair quest no longer loses your progress and locker room access when a day passes while you are still working on it {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} {image=icon_wsis} is no longer undressed while talking to {image=icon_wmom} after coming back from the Grocery Store on the first day {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} on the first day, lunch now always ends at the same time, so spending too long with {image=icon_wmom} can no longer make you miss the Grocery Store invitation {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} the screen no longer turns black instead of showing the living room during the dinner scene of the first day {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} added missing image for {b}Barbecue Skewer{/b} and {b}Rice{/b} items {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} loading a save made during {image=icon_wnei}'s breakfast photo album scene no longer crashes the game {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} the girls sleepover night could get stuck in an endless door knocking loop if you were already in the room when it started. Fixed {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} removed the option to stay in school on Day 2 after {image=icon_wsis} calls you to go home. Then, game time skips to 14:00. It should prevent you for getting stuck at school {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} starting a custom campaign now begins on the correct day for the quests you chose, instead of always jumping to day 3\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.40.2 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translator:{/color} you can now translate the game from inside the game itself. Open it on the {b}Language{/b} menu or by pressing {b}SHIFT+T{/b} anywhere, search for any line you want, see the scene it belongs to so you know what it's about, and rewrite it with the original right below as reference. Everything you write goes straight into the translation files, ready to be sent, and you can even start a brand new language from zero. {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} {image=icon_wsis} reconciliation quest no longer gets error when loading the game phone messages {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} added missing layers of {image=icon_wsis}'s sprites when she's turn around on shopping mall {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Dialogue:{/color} refined a few more dialogue lines from the judgement moment in the female locker room"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.40.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 换衣：{/color} 在 {b}体育课{/b} 和 {b}游泳课前{/b} ，女生可能会在女更衣室换衣服。要是在“错误”的时机走进去，就能看见她们当时正穿到哪一步 {p}✏ {b}查看：{/b} 在事件发生前，先用近景查看房间 {p}✏ {b}解释：{/b} 可以道歉，或者声称是 {b}学生会{/b} 派你来的；但若实际没有相关差事，谎言就会被识破，扣除学生会声望 {p}✏ {b}判定：{/b} 每位女生会根据亲密程度、好感以及自身的矜持程度作出判断，再由多数意见决定结果。回答时，留意她们表情的变化 {p}✏ {b}后果：{/b} 解释成功就能过关；失败则会被进一步追究，当天不许再进入女更衣室 {p} 游戏各处换衣服的女生，也不再始终穿戴整齐 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 约会系统：{/color} 现在可以邀请 {image=icon_wsis} 前往 {b}购物中心{/b} 。只要时间和钱足够，就能自由安排看电影、逛美食广场、合影或试衣服。双方都会为约会换装，服装也会永久解锁在角色菜单里。商场的小面板会显示当天的 {b}浪漫{/b}, {b}欢乐{/b} 和 {b}火辣程度{/b} 。想保留惊喜，也可以按角落按钮将其收起。得分越高，与她的关系加成也越多 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 拍照系统：{/color} 现在可以在购物中心的大头贴摊位，自己制作与 {image=icon_wsis}的合照。照片会作为新图片保存在手机中，并按你的喜好定制。可以选择背景颜色、装饰图层、 {image=icon_hero}的表情，以及横版或竖版 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新舞蹈小游戏：{/color} 与 {image=icon_wnei} 的舞蹈从头重做，现在真正跟随音乐节奏。箭头从右向左移动，准确地在 {b}节拍上{/b}抵达判定线，不再以随机速度下落。每首歌都测定了真实速度并编排谱面，音符对应听到的音乐，音乐与舞蹈也会从第一个音符同步开始。新舞蹈还为 {b}手机{/b}制作了不同版本：竖屏握持，箭头沿四条宽轨道从上方落下，点击对应轨道即可判定。 {p}✏ {b}正确命中：{/b} 加1分 {p}✏ {b}完美命中：{/b} 连续完美时，每次额外加1分 {p}✏ {b}漏接或方向错误：{/b} 每次连续失误多扣1分 {p}✏ {b}更合理的失误判定：{/b} 点错或时机不对，现在只算 {b}一次{/b} 失误，不会再对本来想接的音符重复扣分；触屏上的虚假双击也会忽略 {p}✏ {b}表演天赋：{/b} 提升 {b}表演{/b} 等级会同时放宽两类时机判定，更容易踩准节拍 {p}已优化，尽量让低性能设备也能流畅运行。旧舞蹈暂时保留，方便在新版完善期间作比较。体验更好，还是根本没帮助，都请告诉我。 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 性能设置：{/color} 在 {b}设置{/b} 中新增专门选项，可隐藏 {b}小游戏中的舞者{/b}，或将 {b}动态菜单场景{/b} 换成静态图。手机默认使用静态菜单，兼顾流畅和电量；设备性能允许时，可自行开启动画。菜单插画的内存占用也降至四分之一，游戏下载体积也略有减小 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 游戏瘦身：{/color} 游戏体积减少约 {b}84 MB{/b} ，运行也可能更快。音效和图片重新编码为更轻量的格式；随时间变化的背景调色与光照效果改由GPU处理，因此低性能设备应该也会更流畅 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 存档兼容：{/color} 旧存档现在会获得以后更新新增的房间、地图和学校数据，不再卡在创建存档时的版本 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 修复了16:00至19:00傍晚时段显示场景可能崩溃的问题，这恰好又是外出活动结束的常见时间。所有背景的夕阳光照都恢复正常\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.40.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译：{/color} 恢复了以往更新中丢失的译文，原本的空白文本现在会重新以所选语言显示。另补充了葡萄牙语翻译。 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 小游戏 {b}寻找{/b} 原本仍在读取PNG图片，但资源已转换成WEBP。现在已能正常运行。 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 洗衣家务现在会随天数流逝正确计算时间，衣服不再无限卡住 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 学生会的淋浴维修任务，不会再因跨天而丢失进度或女更衣室权限 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} {image=icon_wsis} 在第一天从杂货店回来后，与 {image=icon_wmom} 交谈时不会再意外脱光 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 第一天的午饭现在总在固定时间结束，因此和 {image=icon_wmom} 相处太久，也不会再错过杂货店的邀请 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 第一天的晚餐场景现在会正确显示客厅，不再黑屏 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 补充了 {b}烤肉串{/b} 和 {b}米饭{/b} 物品缺失的图片 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 读取在 {image=icon_wnei}早餐相册场景中保存的存档，不会再崩溃 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 女生留宿夜开始时，若你已经在房间里，可能陷入无限敲门循环，现已修复 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 第二天在 {image=icon_wsis} 叫你回家后，不再保留继续待在学校的选项，游戏时间会跳到14:00，避免卡在学校 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 自定义开局现在会根据已选任务从正确日期开始，不再总跳到第三天\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.40.2 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译工具：{/color} 现在可以直接在游戏内翻译。通过 {b}语言{/b} 菜单打开，或在任意地方按 {b}SHIFT+T{/b} ，搜索任意文本，查看对应场景以了解语境，再参考下方原文改写。写好的内容会直接保存到翻译文件，随时可以提交，也能从零新建一种语言。 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} {image=icon_wsis} 和解任务加载手机消息时，不会再报错 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 补充了 {image=icon_wsis}在商场转身时的立绘缺失图层 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 对话：{/color} 进一步润色了女更衣室判定环节的部分对白"

