    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.39.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Vivid NPCs:{/color} the girls now have their own diligence, purity and chastity, so their day changes with their mood. A lustful girl with a weak mind may look for a private place to relieve herself, and a hardworking one finishes her activities faster while the laziest ones may even show up late. For now, only {image=icon_wsis} goes that far, in her bedroom {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Lust:{/color} girls gain twice as much lust, but never more than 25% at once {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Chores:{/color} a new Chores Menu lets you clean the house or do the laundry whenever you want, no longer needing the Neighbor's Reunion event. {image=icon_wmom} may clean the house by herself, passing through every room. And if you take {image=icon_wsis}'s dirty clothes while she's in her room, she may end up stuck in the washing machine. It's up to step-bro to help! {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Map:{/color} the Female Locker Room is now available in some conditions. Classmates may be seen bathing in the stalls if you \"accidentally\" open the wrong door during a Student Council quest {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Student Council:{/color} join and leave the council as you wish, and ask for quests. The broken shower quest gives you access to the Female Locker Room while you have it, so feel free to never complete it and have unlimited access {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Hug:{/color} hug {image=icon_wmom} from behind while she's cooking {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Jog:{/color} reworked jogging art. Now you can see all your classmates during P.E classes, and may randomly gain intimacy and love with several of them at once {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Pseudo-Fast-Travel:{/color} the sleep and class buttons now appear anywhere in the building and move you to the right room by themselves {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} the main questline {b}Day 1: Memories{/b} now completes when you start from Day 3"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.39.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 更生动的NPC：{/color} 女生现在各有勤勉、纯真和贞洁属性，会随心情改变一天的活动。欲望高、定力弱的女生可能找私密地点自我纾解；勤快的角色做事更快，懒惰的甚至可能迟到。目前只有 {image=icon_wsis} 会在自己卧室里做到那一步 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 欲望：{/color} 女生获得的欲望翻倍，但单次最多增加25% {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 家务：{/color} 新增家务菜单，随时可以打扫和洗衣，不必再等邻里聚会事件。 {image=icon_wmom} 可能会自行逐个房间打扫。如果趁 {image=icon_wsis}在房间时拿走她的脏衣服，她可能会卡在洗衣机里。该继兄弟出手相助啦！ {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新地图：{/color} 满足特定条件后可以进入女更衣室。学生会任务期间，如果“不小心”开错门，可能看见同学在隔间洗澡 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 学生会：{/color} 可以自由加入、退出学生会并领取任务。持有淋浴维修任务时，就能进入女更衣室；想一直不完成任务、永久保留权限也行 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 拥抱：{/color} 在 {image=icon_wmom} 做饭时从背后抱住她 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 慢跑：{/color} 重制慢跑画面。体育课上能看见全班同学，也可能同时随机增加与多人的亲密度和好感度 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 简易快速移动：{/color} 睡觉和上课按钮会在整栋楼内显示，并自动带你前往相应房间 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 主线任务 {b}第一天：回忆{/b} 在从第三天开局时，现在会正确完成"

