    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.38.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Meeting:{/color} a new {b}Meeting{/b} option in the interaction menu lets you invite a character to join you in a future event. For now {image=icon_wsis} and {image=icon_wmom} can be invited to the Neighbors Reunion, which happens on Sundays from 10:00 to 12:59 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Complete Scene:{/color} the sleepover with {image=icon_wsis} and {image=icon_wnei} is finished. It starts once you have at least 40% intimacy with both {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Chores & Tasks:{/color} clean the house and do homework for {image=icon_wsis} to earn more love from both girls. Dirt builds up as days pass, and a clean house stays clean longer. Do their tasks so they agree to go with you to the Neighbor's Reunion {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Sunrise Animation:{/color} added a neighborhood animation on the day transition {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Image Choices:{/color} the bedroom training got a more dynamic look, with images for the most relevant choices {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Progress Cap:{/color} {image=icon_wsis} and {image=icon_wnei} start capped at 10% intimacy and grow to 40%, {image=icon_wmom} starts at 40% {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Character Guide:{/color} added a content guide for {image=icon_wcou}, {image=icon_wnei}, {image=icon_wsis}, {image=icon_wmom} and the P.E Teacher in the characters menu {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Vibration:{/color} vibration is now optional for mobile devices, in Settings {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Quick Menu:{/color} the Quick Menu buttons are hidden during minigames so they don't get in the way {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translation:{/color} updated Portuguese, Spanish and Italian (a big thank you to mensch, for joining the translation! 💛)\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.38.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translation:{/color} fixed lots of wrong Portuguese lines {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} {p}✏ no more corruption warning when loading saves of the same update, and no more error while saving {p}✏ characters no longer fail to load during the cooking minigame {p}✏ {image=icon_wsis} no longer shows up at the Neighbors Reunion table when she shouldn't be there {p}✏ after the intro, {image=icon_wsis} stays in her bedroom and {image=icon_wmom} and {image=icon_wnei} in the living room, so nobody appears in a strange place. They're free again after you talk to {image=icon_wnei} {p}✏ training consumes time and has limits again {p}✏ on Day 2, {image=icon_wsis} comes to talk to you in her common school uniform, and you're no longer prevented from bathing from 12:00 {p}✏ {image=icon_wsis} waits 20 min for you at school after eating, so you can go home together {p}✏ phone wallpaper starts centered, and the gallery opens on the image you clicked {p}✏ changed the Park background, fixed the Ludo guide screen on mobile, and fixed the stat counting after the Thug Of War minigame with {image=icon_hpap} {p}✏ probably fixed NPCs changing clothes in front of you, and adjusted the dialogue box so text no longer gets cut"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.38.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 聚会：{/color} 新增 {b}聚会{/b} 互动选项，可以邀请角色参加未来的活动。目前 {image=icon_wsis} 和 {image=icon_wmom} 可受邀参加周日10:00至12:59举行的邻里聚会 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 完整场景：{/color} 与 {image=icon_wsis} 和 {image=icon_wnei} 的留宿事件已完成。开始条件是亲密度均至少达到40%，对象为 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 家务与任务：{/color} 打扫房屋，并替 {image=icon_wsis} 做作业，可以提高两位女生的好感度。房屋随天数变脏，干净的房子能保持更久。帮她们完成任务，才能让她们答应一起参加邻里聚会 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 日出动画：{/color} 加入跨天时的社区动画 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 图像选项：{/color} 卧室训练的主要选项加入图片，画面更生动 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 进度上限：{/color} {image=icon_wsis} 和 {image=icon_wnei} 的亲密度初始上限为10%，以后可提升至40%； {image=icon_wmom} 则从40%开始 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 角色指引：{/color} 角色菜单新增 {image=icon_wcou}, {image=icon_wnei}, {image=icon_wsis}, {image=icon_wmom} 和体育老师的内容指引 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 震动：{/color} 移动设备现在可在设置中选择是否启用震动 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 快捷菜单：{/color} 小游戏期间会隐藏快捷菜单按钮，避免碍事 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译：{/color} 更新葡萄牙语、西班牙语与意大利语翻译。非常感谢mensch加入翻译工作！💛\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.38.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译：{/color} 修复了大量葡萄牙语错译 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} {p}✏ 读取同版本存档不再误报损坏，保存时也不再报错 {p}✏ 修复烹饪小游戏里角色加载失败的问题 {p}✏ {image=icon_wsis} 不会再在不该出现时出现在邻里聚会餐桌旁 {p}✏ 序章结束后， {image=icon_wsis} 留在卧室， {image=icon_wmom} 和 {image=icon_wnei} 留在客厅，避免角色出现在奇怪的位置。恢复自由活动之前，需先与以下角色交谈： {image=icon_wnei} {p}✏ 训练恢复消耗时间，也重新有了次数限制 {p}✏ 第二天， {image=icon_wsis} 会穿普通校服来找你交谈；12:00起也不会再被阻止洗澡 {p}✏ {image=icon_wsis} 吃完饭后，会在学校等你20分钟，方便一起回家 {p}✏ 手机壁纸初始居中，相册会打开实际点击的图片 {p}✏ 更换公园背景，修复移动端飞行棋指引界面，以及与以下角色拔河后的属性计算： {image=icon_hpap} {p}✏ 可能修复了NPC当面换衣服的问题，并调整对话框，避免文字被截断"

    # game/options.rpy:50
    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.37.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Cooking:{/color} cooking and item crafting are now a minigame. It's a prototype with simpler mechanics and temporary art, so more should come later {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Stats & Perks:{/color} each of the 3 stats is now divided into 3 sub-stats, and the perks were reworked around them. {b}Cook{/b} is a new skill, {b}Sensuality{/b} replaces Charm and grows by touching, and {b}Social{/b} replaces Persuasion and grows by chatting {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Content:{/color} have lunch with your neighbors on the weekend by starting the quest in front of your house from 9:00 to 12:00. Go with {image=icon_wmom}, {image=icon_wsis}, or alone, then play ludo with {image=icon_wnei} or help her parents prepare a barbecue to earn their trust. It requires 10% intimacy with {image=icon_wnei} and 10% trust with her parents {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Minigame Balance:{/color} {b}Hold{/b} is now called {b}Balance{/b} and got fairer but more challenging, and {b}Find{/b} got different maps with random characters wearing outfits that fit the place {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Settings:{/color} reorganized the settings screen of the Main Menu {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} names are kept on new games when Global Data is on, and dialogues with emojis like \"❤\" no longer break the game\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.37.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Sprites:{/color} your neighbors {image=icon_hpap} and {image=icon_wmam} got sprites and icons, and you can now fully replace both of them if you are with {image=icon_wmom} and {image=icon_wsis} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Minigame Rework:{/color} cooking uses common character sprites with smoother transitions, {b}Find{/b} got bigger characters and a fairer difficulty, and {b}Memory{/b} only shows the frames if you have the perk for it {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} {p}✏ the game no longer gets stuck on the night celebration of the 1st day {p}✏ walking home with {image=icon_wsis} on Day 2 now ends correctly, and she no longer stays at school or keeps appearing asleep in her room {p}✏ removed the interaction options from {image=icon_wmom} during special events and from {image=icon_wcou}'s first scene {p}✏ added {image=icon_hero}'s missing face at the end of the cooking content and {image=icon_wsis}'s missing clothes in the {b}Take care of step-sis{/b} scene {p}✏ added the missing perks in {image=icon_hero}'s database when cheat is disabled {p}✏ fixed errors in the {image=icon_wnei} and {image=icon_wmam} breakfast scene and in {image=icon_wsis}'s movie content {p}✏ probably fixed the game crashing on MacOS devices\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.37.2 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Live2D Bug Fix:{/color} changed the exportation just to make (at least a little more) sure it'll work"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.37.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 烹饪：{/color} 烹饪和物品制作现在采用小游戏。这还是原型版，操作较简单，美术为临时资源，后续还会完善 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 属性与天赋：{/color} 三大属性各拆分为三个子属性，天赋也围绕它们重新设计。 {b}烹饪{/b} 是新增技能； {b}性感{/b} 代替原来的魅惑，通过触碰提升； {b}社交{/b} 代替说服，通过聊天提升 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新增内容：{/color} 周末9:00至12:00在家门前开启任务，可以与邻居一起吃午饭。可以带上 {image=icon_wmom}, {image=icon_wsis}，也可以独自前往，然后与 {image=icon_wnei} 玩飞行棋，或帮她父母准备烧烤，赢得信任。需要与 {image=icon_wnei} 的亲密度达到10%，且她父母的信任度达到10% {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 小游戏平衡：{/color} {b}坚持{/b} 现更名为 {b}平衡{/b} ，更公平，也更有挑战性； {b}寻找{/b} 加入不同地图，随机角色会穿符合场景的衣服 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 设置：{/color} 重新整理了主菜单的设置界面 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 开启全局数据后，新游戏会保留名字；带有“❤”等表情符号的对白也不再导致游戏报错\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.37.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新立绘：{/color} 你的邻居 {image=icon_hpap} 和 {image=icon_wmam} 加入立绘和图标；如果你和 {image=icon_wmom} 和 {image=icon_wsis} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 小游戏重制：{/color} 烹饪改用普通角色立绘，过渡更流畅； {b}寻找{/b} 的角色显示更大，难度也更公平； {b}记忆{/b} 只会在你拥有对应天赋时显示提示框 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} {p}✏ 第一天晚上的庆祝活动不再卡住 {p}✏ 第二天与 {image=icon_wsis} 一起回家会正常结束，她不会再留在学校，或一直在卧室显示睡姿 {p}✏ 特殊事件期间移除了 {image=icon_wmom} 的互动选项，也移除了 {image=icon_wcou}初次场景中的互动选项 {p}✏ 补充了 {image=icon_hero}在烹饪内容结束时缺失的脸，以及 {image=icon_wsis}在 {b}照顾继姐妹{/b} 场景中缺失的衣服 {p}✏ 关闭作弊后， {image=icon_hero}的资料库会正确显示原本缺失的天赋 {p}✏ 修复了 {image=icon_wnei} 和 {image=icon_wmam} 早餐场景，以及 {image=icon_wsis}电影内容中的报错 {p}✏ 可能修好了MacOS设备上的崩溃\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.37.2 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Live2D问题修复：{/color} 调整导出方式，希望能更确定一点，至少让它更有可能正常工作"

