    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.36.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Minigames:{/color} your stat trainings are now minigames. It's a prototype, and each stat may later be split into 3 sub-stats with their own mechanics {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Content:{/color} spend time with the girls in {image=icon_wsis}'s bedroom on Saturday night {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Faster Start & Progress:{/color} the time button can skip whole days to the weekday you want, the Character Database menus are skipped when Global Data is enabled, and a custom new game gives you a 5x stat bonus to grow your points easily {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Edit Data UI:{/color} the Edit Menu (📝) was removed from the Player Menu (📱). Rename characters and edit stats through the Character Menu (👤) with the cheat code enabled {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Emojis:{/color} emoji texts are more colorful and now appear on the checkmarks of the buttons {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Name Generator:{/color} more name categories were added for randomly generated names {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Engine Update:{/color} the game moved from Ren'Py 8.0.3 to 8.5.2 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translation:{/color} updated Spanish {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} characters no longer finish bathing instantly, so bathing scenes are available again. The charisma bonus scales normally, and stats no longer reset on loading\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.36.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Cheat:{/color} added an infinite perks option for cheat mode {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Theme:{/color} added a button to change the theme on the main menu"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.36.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 小游戏：{/color} 属性训练现在采用小游戏。这是原型版，后续每种属性可能拆成三个子属性，并拥有各自的玩法 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新增内容：{/color} 周六晚上，可以与女生们一起在 {image=icon_wsis}的卧室消磨时光 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 更快开局与成长：{/color} 时间按钮可以整天跳过，直到所需星期；开启全局数据后会跳过角色资料菜单；自定义新游戏会获得五倍属性加成，方便成长 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 数据编辑界面：{/color} 从玩家菜单（📱）移除编辑菜单（📝）。开启作弊码后，通过角色菜单（👤）修改名字和属性 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 表情符号：{/color} 文字中的表情符号更鲜艳，也用于按钮勾选标记 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 名字生成器：{/color} 随机名字加入更多分类 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 引擎升级：{/color} 游戏从Ren’Py 8.0.3升级至8.5.2 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译：{/color} 更新西班牙语翻译 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 角色不再瞬间洗完澡，因此洗澡场景重新可见；魅力加成正常随数值变化，读取存档也不会再重置属性\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.36.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 作弊：{/color} 作弊模式新增无限天赋选项 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 主题：{/color} 主菜单新增切换主题按钮"

