    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.35.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Content:{/color} invite {image=icon_wsis} to watch a movie together at night, and buy corn for the fridge to get the popcorn bonus. If she's afraid to sleep alone, you can share your bed with her. It requires 30% intimacy, 50% love and the {b}Reconciliation{/b} quest {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Reworked Checkpoint:{/color} the New Game menu has a nicer layout with panels and a custom option, so you can start from the point you want. Starting from the 3rd day or a custom checkpoint now begins on Tuesday {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Custom Pass Time:{/color} skip as many hours as you want with the Pass Time button {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Save Safety:{/color} loading very old saves was disabled to avoid conflicts between versions"
