    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.34.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Content:{/color} make {image=icon_wsis} angry to start a special story scene where her background is revealed in an emotional moment. It unlocks new dialogues with her and takes your intimacy to the next level. Maximum intimacy is now 30% for {image=icon_wsis}, {image=icon_wnei} and {image=icon_wmom} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} More Arts:{/color} when watching TV with {image=icon_wsis} and {image=icon_wnei} you may embrace them if you have maximum intimacy {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} UI Layout:{/color} the quick menu moved to the right side, and the choice buttons got a look of their own, fitting into 1 to 3 columns depending on how many options are on screen {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} the girls and {image=icon_hprv} now react properly when asked about your girl preference, and the game no longer gets stuck on a black screen going home with {image=icon_wsis}, between 12:00 and 13:00 on Day 2, or after gifting {image=icon_wsis} on the 1st day"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.34.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新增内容：{/color} 惹恼 {image=icon_wsis} 可触发一段特别剧情，在动人的时刻揭露她的过去。解锁新对话，并让亲密度更进一步。以下角色的亲密度上限现为30%： {image=icon_wsis}, {image=icon_wnei} 和 {image=icon_wmom} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 更多插画：{/color} 看电视时，如果与 {image=icon_wsis} 和 {image=icon_wnei} 达到亲密度上限，就可以搂着她们 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 界面布局：{/color} 快捷菜单移至右侧；选项按钮使用专属样式，并按选项数量排成一至三列 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 女生们和 {image=icon_hprv} 现在会正确回应你对女生类型的偏好；第二天12:00至13:00与 {image=icon_wsis}一起回家，或第一天送礼给 {image=icon_wsis} 之后，不会再黑屏卡住"

