    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.33.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Intimacy Level Up:{/color} {image=icon_wmom} and {image=icon_wnei} can reach 20% intimacy, and there are more intimate moments with them and {image=icon_wsis}. Hug {image=icon_wsis} while she's drawing and she may knock you out until the next hour, but her lust goes way up. On the sofa the girls may embrace you, sit on your lap, or fall asleep after 22h so you can carry them to their rooms. And you can help {image=icon_wmom} take her bra off while she's changing {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Training:{/color} training now takes 30min instead of 1h, and you can train with {image=icon_wnei} if you're strong enough to lift her up {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Perception:{/color} unlock more info about characters in the Character Menu by leveling up your perception skill {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} UI Rework:{/color} the interface was reorganized for a better experience on any device, with a new game icon, a new android splash art, and a phone wallpaper system where you choose the zoom and position {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Optional Tutoring:{/color} tutoring {image=icon_wdis} lets you choose between the minigame or simple stat gaining {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} {p}✏ permanent names and calls are fixed, and the skip button works again {p}✏ skills and stats appear updated in their menus, both under the phone icon {p}✏ fixed {image=icon_wsis}'s clothes during the hit, and the error when facing {image=icon_hriv} on the second day {p}✏ the grocery store scene on the 1st day no longer falls into an infinite loop\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.33.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} the game no longer closes on android after the loading screen, no longer errors when removing an item from the cart while shopping, and no longer crashes when the intro music takes too long to load. Also fixed a few translation errors"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.33.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 亲密度提升：{/color} {image=icon_wmom} 和 {image=icon_wnei} 的亲密度可达到20%；与她们以及 {image=icon_wsis}之间也有更多亲密时刻。在 {image=icon_wsis} 画画时抱她，可能被打晕到下一个整点，但她的欲望会大涨。女生在沙发上可能搂着你、坐在腿上，或在22点后睡着，让你抱回房间。另外，还可以在 {image=icon_wmom} 换衣服时，帮她脱下胸罩 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 训练：{/color} 训练时间由一小时缩短为30分钟。如果力气足够抱起 {image=icon_wnei} ，还能和她一起训练 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 感知：{/color} 提升感知技能，可在角色菜单解锁更多资料 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 界面重制：{/color} 调整界面，改善各类设备的体验；更新游戏图标、安卓启动插画，并加入可自行缩放定位的手机壁纸系统 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 可选辅导：{/color} 辅导 {image=icon_wdis} 时，可选择玩小游戏，或直接获得属性 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} {p}✏ 修复永久名字与称谓，跳过按钮也恢复正常 {p}✏ 技能与属性现在会在各自菜单正确更新，两个菜单位于手机图标下 {p}✏ 修复了 {image=icon_wsis}挨打时的衣服，以及第二天面对 {image=icon_hriv} 时的报错 {p}✏ 第一天杂货店场景不再陷入无限循环\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.33.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 安卓版不再在加载后关闭；购物时从购物车移除物品不再报错；序章音乐加载过久也不会再崩溃。另外修复了一些翻译错误"

    # game/options.rpy:50
    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.32.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} NPC:{/color} characters are a little less robotic. They have better defined routines, hobbies and needs that change with the situation. And if they aren't where an activity happens, just invite them to go there together {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} City Map:{/color} the city map was reworked to show the whole city, with roads and colorful buildings, and it takes the lighting of the time of day. At night you can see the city lights on it {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} School:{/color} the school building was rebuilt with a reorganized architecture, new visuals and 3 floors. For now it's only visual {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Navigation:{/color} map navigation got new effects and visual names so you better know where to go. Don't like the text appearing? You can disable it in Settings whenever you want {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Dance:{/color} the Dance minigame is back, and now with sung songs. Play it by hanging out with {image=icon_wnei} at home on weekends. It's smoother, and no longer finishes before the music ends {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Permanent Data:{/color} Permanent Names became Global Data. Enable it and your family calls and starting stats are already filled in on every new game {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} {image=icon_wsis} no longer gets angry if you try to hug her, the grocery store scene on the first day no longer gets stuck, the visual glitches on the second day at school are gone, and {image=icon_wcou}'s first scene no longer errors\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.32.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} School Moments:{/color} school schedules and classmate quests were adjusted to the updated time, so no more long skips or time rollbacks. Classmates now have pastime activities that lead them to random places where you can find them, and they head to the P.E or swimming maps when that's the current class {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Activity Time:{/color} watching TV or cooking no longer costs a fixed hour. You spend the same time the girl you're with does {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Character Scenes:{/color} {image=icon_wsis} and {image=icon_wnei} content now follows their activity moments, and you can see {image=icon_wsis} changing clothes for school {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Error Screen:{/color} added a {b}Load{/b} button to the error screen so you can pick another checkpoint {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translation:{/color} added Spanish {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} fixed the missing expressions on character sprites outside Day 2, and minutes are no longer float numbers. NPCs still aren't sleeping at night, so you autosleep instead until that is fixed"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.32.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} NPC：{/color} 角色不再那么机械化，拥有更明确的日程、爱好，以及随情况变化的需求。活动时若她不在对应地点，可以邀请她一起过去 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 城市地图：{/color} 重制城市地图，展示全城道路和彩色建筑，并随时段改变光照；夜晚还能看到城市灯光 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 学校：{/color} 重建校舍，调整结构，更新画面，增加为三层。目前只是视觉变化 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 导航：{/color} 地图导航新增特效和地点文字，更容易知道该去哪儿。不喜欢弹出的文字，可随时在设置中关闭 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 舞蹈：{/color} 舞蹈小游戏回归，加入有人声的歌曲。周末在家与 {image=icon_wnei} 一起消遣即可游玩。运行更流畅，也不会在音乐结束前提前结束 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 永久数据：{/color} 永久名字升级为全局数据。开启后，每次新游戏都会自动填好家庭称谓和初始属性 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} {image=icon_wsis} 不再因尝试拥抱而生气；第一天杂货店不再卡住；第二天学校的画面异常已修复； {image=icon_wcou}的初次场景也不再报错\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.32.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 校园时光：{/color} 校园日程和同学任务按新时间重新调整，避免大幅跳时或倒退。同学闲暇时会去随机地点；体育课和游泳课时，会前往对应运动场或泳池 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 活动时间：{/color} 看电视与做饭不再固定花一小时，而是与同行女生的活动时间一致 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 角色场景：{/color} {image=icon_wsis} 和 {image=icon_wnei} 内容现在随活动时段触发，并可看到 {image=icon_wsis} 换上学衣服 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 错误界面：{/color} 在报错界面新增 {b}读取{/b} 按钮，方便选择其他检查点 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译：{/color} 新增西班牙语翻译 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 修复第二天之外角色立绘缺失表情的问题，分钟不再显示小数。NPC夜间仍不睡觉，修好之前先让主角自动睡眠"

    # game/options.rpy:50
    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.31.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New & Updated Scene:{/color} cook or eat with {image=icon_wsis}. You can fry eggs together and serve both of you, choosing who gets the best food or just giving everything to her. If she eats more than one dish, you'll have to help her get to her room {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Item & Craft System:{/color} items were reworked to have their own particularities, like a quality level from 1 (terrible) to 5 (perfect), and you can create an item during the cooking minigame {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Visual Transitions & Hang Out:{/color} scenes that used to be quick transitions or black screens now have art of their own. You can eat and go shopping with {image=icon_wsis}, and watch TV with her, {image=icon_wnei} and {image=icon_wmom} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Stepsis Mechanics:{/color} {image=icon_wsis} has an anger system. The higher it is, the more aggressive she tends to be with you. For now it only shows in her night scene {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Stepmom Mechanics:{/color} {image=icon_wmom} checks the fridge before making your breakfast, and goes shopping early in the morning if the ingredients are missing {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Icon:{/color} changed the game icon for android. Hope you like :3 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Loading:{/color} click the screen after loading a save and all the pop-up notifications are cleared at once {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} the game no longer crashes in the dialogue after the first check-up with {image=icon_wcou}, and the clock no longer displays fractional numbers"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.31.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新增与更新场景：{/color} 与 {image=icon_wsis}一起做饭或吃饭。可以煎蛋并给双方盛饭，决定把更好的食物给谁，或全让她吃。她若吃不止一份，还得扶她回房间 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 物品与制作系统：{/color} 重制物品系统，加入各自特性，例如1（糟糕）至5（完美）的品质等级；烹饪小游戏也能制作物品 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 画面过渡与消遣：{/color} 原本一闪而过或黑屏的场景，现在有了专门插画。可以与 {image=icon_wsis}吃饭、购物，也能和她、 {image=icon_wnei} 和 {image=icon_wmom} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 继姐妹机制：{/color} {image=icon_wsis} 拥有怒气系统。数值越高，对你越凶。目前只体现在夜间场景 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 继母机制：{/color} {image=icon_wmom} 做早餐前会查看冰箱，缺食材时会一早出去采购 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新图标：{/color} 更换了安卓游戏图标，希望你们喜欢 :3 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 加载：{/color} 读取存档后，点击屏幕即可一次清除全部弹出提示 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 第一次体检后与 {image=icon_wcou}对话不再崩溃，时钟也不再显示小数"

    # game/options.rpy:50
    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.30.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Scene:{/color} if you completed the quest {b}A New Journey{/b}, spend time with {image=icon_wcou} in her office until 20:00 and accept her ride home {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Optional Content Types:{/color} some content is now optional and disabled by default, so you turn on only what you like in Settings. {b}Femdom{/b} brings a hentai animation with {image=icon_wcou}, and {b}Elder{/b} brings ecchi moments with {image=icon_wgma} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Map:{/color} updated the map visual {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Database:{/color} added WAUN, sister of {image=icon_wmom} and mother of {image=icon_wcou}, with a random name for reference for now\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.30.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Thematic Main Menu:{/color} it's Halloween! Now you can click the main menu screen to show or hide the UI {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} fixed a bug in the Russian translation"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.30.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新场景：{/color} 如果已完成任务 {b}新的旅程{/b}，就在 {image=icon_wcou} 的诊所待到20:00，并接受她送你回家的邀请 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 可选内容类型：{/color} 部分内容改为可选，默认关闭，可在设置中只开启自己喜欢的类型。 {b}女主导{/b} 会加入与 {image=icon_wcou}的成人动画； {b}老年内容{/b} 会加入与 {image=icon_wgma} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 地图：{/color} 更新地图画面 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 资料库：{/color} 新增WAUN，她是 {image=icon_wmom} 的姐妹，也是 {image=icon_wcou}的母亲，目前先随机生成名字作为参考\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.30.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 节日主菜单：{/color} 万圣节到啦！现在点击主菜单画面，即可显示或隐藏界面 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 修复俄语翻译的一个问题"

    # game/options.rpy:50
    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.29.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} X-Content:{/color} {image=icon_wsuk} and the P.E Teacher have interactive hentai scenes, with dynamic animations, sound effects and a few interactions. Find {image=icon_wsuk} at 6pm on the School Upstairs Hallway after the {b}Club's Start{/b} quest with {image=icon_hine}, and the P.E Teacher on the Sports Court during class once you reach 20 PHY. Both are repeatable every day and give you XP {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} City Map:{/color} the visual city map is back, this time simpler, smaller and cute. There's an option to disable it if your device doesn't handle it {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Walking:{/color} art of you walking with {image=icon_wsis} appears when you go with her to home, school and the grocery store, with variations for her clothes and your intimacy level {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Voice Beep:{/color} added a personal voice for the P.E Teacher {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} the map navigation UI no longer appears in scenes after loading, and no more errors loading your common clothes sprite or naming WDAN\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.29.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} map navigation appears correctly on the Office Building facade at any hour, so you won't get stuck there"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.29.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 成人互动内容：{/color} {image=icon_wsuk} 和体育老师加入互动成人场景，包含动态动画、音效及少量互动。在与 {image=icon_wsuk} 相关内容中，可于18:00在学校楼上走廊遇到她，需先完成 {b}社团成立{/b} 任务，对应角色为 {image=icon_hine}；体育老师则在体育课的运动场，要求20点体能。两者每天都可重复，并提供经验值 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 城市地图：{/color} 可视城市地图回归，这次更简单、小巧、可爱；设备带不动时，可以选择关闭 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 步行：{/color} 与 {image=icon_wsis} 一起步行回家、上学或去杂货店时，会显示同行插画，并根据她的衣服和亲密度变化 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 对话提示音：{/color} 为体育老师加入专属声音 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 读取后，场景中不再残留地图导航界面；普通衣服立绘加载，以及给WDAN命名时也不再报错\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.29.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 办公楼外立面的地图导航现在全天正常显示，避免卡在那里"

    # game/options.rpy:50
    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.28.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Updated Scene:{/color} the continuation of {image=icon_wnei}'s scene with {image=icon_wmam} is available. Meet her at the windows of your rooms on Saturday morning at 7am and accept the invitation for breakfast {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Minigame:{/color} a time-click minigame. Click when the mark is closer to the green bar and further from the red one {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Reworked Scene:{/color} in the locker room on Day 2, {image=icon_hprv}'s gore was changed to cartoonized effects, {image=icon_wgal}'s appearance was reworked, and her meeting scene now has a full background with other classmates {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Hang Out:{/color} jog with your classmates during sport class socialization, and all classmates can now appear during swimming class {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} X-Content:{/color} {image=icon_wsuk}'s content no longer requires the main quest. It's available at 6pm on the School Upstairs Hallway after the {b}Club's Start{/b} quest with {image=icon_hine} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Reworked BGM:{/color} the music {b}Good Vibes{/b} got a more emotional feeling {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translation:{/color} updated Portuguese and Spanish {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} practical mode for dialogues works again, and can even be changed in the middle of a dialogue\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.28.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} fixed the {b}Appropriate Goodbye{/b} scene of {image=icon_wnei}, so the clothes appear correctly this time\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.28.2 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} {image=icon_wsuk}'s old approach content no longer tries to load\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.28.3 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Art Rework:{/color} {image=icon_wsis} wears a white blouse and black shorts before the grocery store scene {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} characters no longer appear naked or break the game because of their outfits, and skipping is blocked during the item buying window\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.28.4 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Scene Update:{/color} {image=icon_wnei}'s {b}Copy & Paste DNA{/b} scene now starts from the quest button whenever you decide, is still playable in later game weeks, and got lighting and fading effects to look more complete\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.28.5 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} removed the scene check added in 0.28.3, since it left the game stuck after the Day 1 celebration. Also added a clothing check on loading so characters never show up missing their outfit"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.28.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 场景更新：{/color} 现在可以继续体验 {image=icon_wnei}与 {image=icon_wmam} 的后续场景。周六早上7点，在两家卧室窗边碰面，并接受早餐邀请 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新小游戏：{/color} 新增时机点击小游戏：指针越靠近绿色条、越远离红色条时点击，效果越好 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 场景重制：{/color} 第二天更衣室里， {image=icon_hprv}的血腥效果改为卡通表现； {image=icon_wgal}的外观重新设计，初遇场景也加入完整背景和其他同学 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 消遣：{/color} 体育课的社交活动可和同学慢跑；游泳课上，所有同学都有机会出现 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 成人互动内容：{/color} {image=icon_wsuk}的内容不再要求完成主线。18:00可在学校楼上走廊体验，需先完成 {b}社团成立{/b} 任务，对应角色为 {image=icon_hine} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 背景音乐重制：{/color} 乐曲 {b}美好氛围{/b} 现在更有情感 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译：{/color} 更新葡萄牙语与西班牙语翻译 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 实用对话模式恢复正常，还能在对话中途切换\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.28.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 修复了 {b}好好道别{/b} 场景，对应角色为 {image=icon_wnei}，现在衣服能正确显示了\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.28.2 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} {image=icon_wsuk}的旧接近事件不再尝试加载\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.28.3 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 插画重制：{/color} {image=icon_wsis} 在杂货店场景前会穿白色上衣和黑色短裤 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 角色不再因为服装而裸露或导致游戏报错；购物窗口期间禁止跳过\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.28.4 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 场景更新：{/color} {image=icon_wnei}的 {b}复制粘贴的基因{/b} 场景现在可随时用任务按钮触发，后续周目也能游玩；并加入光照和淡入淡出，让场景更完整\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.28.5 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 移除了0.28.3加入的场景检查，它会导致第一天庆祝后卡住；另在读取时检查服装，避免角色缺衣服"

