    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.27.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translation:{/color} you can now test any language in game. Take a look at the Language options here in the Main Menu if you're interested in translating the game. A few languages were updated too {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Updated Scene:{/color} join {image=icon_wsis} in her late night snack for more content {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} More Animation:{/color} {image=icon_wsis}'s late snack scene and {image=icon_wgot}'s meeting scene are now animated {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Art Rework:{/color} {image=icon_wgal}'s meeting scene was redrawn in the current art style {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Hang Out:{/color} more socialization options with more characters. For {image=icon_wsis}, catch her at the School Frontyard before she goes home and ask to hang out, with 10% intimacy {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Minigame Warning:{/color} options that lead to a minigame now tell you what's coming, so you can prepare yourself {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} fixed the error after interacting with {image=icon_wdel}, {image=icon_wlaz} and {image=icon_wuza}, and probably fixed the error that used to happen in a lot of moments after loading\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.27.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Prevention:{/color} removed the arrow minigame on mobile as a temporary solution for the arrows not showing up\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.27.2 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} new games no longer roll back to the character creation moment in {image=icon_wric}'s meeting scene, the arrow keys work again in {image=icon_wsis}'s dodge minigame, {image=icon_wsis}'s part of the intro no longer errors, {image=icon_wpre} and {image=icon_wgal} sprites are correct on their Day 2 appearance, and the UI buttons are hidden during {image=icon_wsis}'s first call to go home"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.27.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译：{/color} 现在可在游戏中测试任何语言。有兴趣翻译的话，看看主菜单的语言选项。部分语言也已更新 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 场景更新：{/color} 与 {image=icon_wsis} 一起吃夜宵，可体验更多内容 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 更多动画：{/color} {image=icon_wsis}的夜宵场景和 {image=icon_wgot}的初遇场景现在带有动画 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 插画重制：{/color} {image=icon_wgal}的初遇场景按当前画风重绘 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 消遣：{/color} 加入更多角色的消遣选项。对于 {image=icon_wsis}，可以在她回家前到学校前院找她，亲密度10%即可邀请一起玩 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 小游戏提示：{/color} 会进入小游戏的选项，现在会提前提示，方便准备 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 修复与 {image=icon_wdel}, {image=icon_wlaz} 和 {image=icon_wuza}互动后的报错，也可能修复了读取后在许多时刻出现的报错\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.27.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 防止报错：{/color} 移动端暂时移除箭头小游戏，作为箭头无法显示的临时解决办法\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.27.2 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 新游戏在 {image=icon_wric}初遇场景中不再倒退回创建角色； {image=icon_wsis}的闪避小游戏恢复方向键操作； {image=icon_wsis}的序章部分不再报错； {image=icon_wpre} 和 {image=icon_wgal} 第二天登场的立绘正确显示； {image=icon_wsis}第一次叫你回家时，界面按钮会隐藏"

