    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.23.1 - Major & Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Scene & Character:{/color} go to the School Downstairs Hallway from 10:00 to 10:29 to meet and unlock {image=icon_wgot}. She becomes available for interaction with a few dialogue variations {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New BGM:{/color} a fantastic gloomy music, {b}Mystic{/b}, joins the playlist {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Livid Background:{/color} background characters were added to a few school scenes {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Voice Beep:{/color} some dialogue beeps simulate a more realistic voice. For now only {image=icon_hero}, {image=icon_wnei} and {image=icon_wgot}, and it should reach everyone if well accepted {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Cheat Code:{/color} the cheat activation now works in any save, 😇 but also resets on every update {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} the quest {b}A New Journey{/b} no longer gets stuck in an endless wait, hugging {image=icon_wsis} at night no longer lets you pass the day without sleeping, and {image=icon_wgal}'s meeting scene no longer errors in Portuguese"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.23.1 - 大型与小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新场景与角色：{/color} 10:00至10:29到学校楼下走廊，遇见并解锁 {image=icon_wgot}。她将开放互动，并有少量对白变化 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新背景音乐：{/color} 气氛阴郁而迷人的乐曲 {b}神秘{/b}加入播放列表 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 鲜活背景：{/color} 部分校园场景加入背景人物 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 对话提示音：{/color} 部分对话提示音更接近真实人声。目前只有 {image=icon_hero}, {image=icon_wnei} 和 {image=icon_wgot}，如果反馈好，会推广到所有人 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 作弊码：{/color} 现在任何存档都能开启作弊，😇但每次更新都会重置 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 任务 {b}新的旅程{/b} 不再无限等待卡住；夜间拥抱 {image=icon_wsis} 不会再跳过睡眠直接跨天；葡萄牙语版 {image=icon_wgal}的初遇场景不再报错"

