    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.22.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}⚠ {b}Variable Changed:{/b} some important variables were renamed to avoid menu bugs, so a few checkpoints may be corrupt. If an error appears and there's no {b}Ignore{/b} option, try {b}Rollback{/b}. It should work on the most recent saves. The Ren'Py error screen is a little more beautiful now too (I guess xD) {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Language:{/color} Russian is added to the game! 💛 Thanks to BigFloppa 💛 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Reworked Scene:{/color} the Grocery Store scene is more visually appealing and organized, and you can invite {image=icon_wsis} there again any day between 13:00 and 16:59 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Improved Scene:{/color} the second day got a more interactive introduction to your first day at school, presenting it in a comical way (yes, it took me more than a year to explain the name of the school), with 2 more photos for your gallery {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Item System:{/color} more items were added, and shopping got a cart so you have more control and information about what you're buying {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Scene:{/color} give {image=icon_wmom} a massage at 20:00 of any day, after the night celebration of the 1st day. There are only 2 images for now, more should come {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Tutoring System:{/color} the tutoring minigame is back, with more info and better balance {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Window Theme:{/color} change the theme of the menu and dialogue windows in Settings {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Character Recolor:{/color} {image=icon_wpre} has a new color palette {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Prevention:{/color} the visual map was removed to avoid crashes on weaker devices, and heavy text effects were taken out of the auditorium dialogues because they ran too slowly on some devices {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} dialogue beeps are no longer hidden in the audio settings\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.22.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Main Menu UI:{/color} the social media text buttons became icon buttons {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Pseudo-Bug Fix:{/color} updated {image=icon_wpre}'s icon, and now you can recognize her on the second day if you already knew her from the grocery store, earning bonus love points on the meeting. Buying the plushy at the end of that scene also earns you a love reaction {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} updated the dialogue window for mobile, {image=icon_wpre}'s name shows as Attendant during the grocery store event, infinite money no longer makes an infinite loop while shopping, and {image=icon_wmom}'s infinite cooking hangout is gone"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.22.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}⚠ {b}变量变更：{/b} 为避免菜单问题，重命名了部分重要变量，因此一些检查点可能损坏。若报错且没有 {b}忽略{/b} 选项，请尝试 {b}回退{/b}。近期存档应该能用。Ren’Py错误界面也稍微变好看了一点，我觉得啦，哈哈 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新语言：{/color} 游戏加入俄语！💛感谢BigFloppa💛 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 场景重制：{/color} 杂货店场景更美观、更整齐；每天13:00至16:59，还可以再次邀请 {image=icon_wsis} 前往 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 场景改善：{/color} 第二天入学剧情更有互动性，以搞笑方式介绍校园（没错，解释校名竟然花了我一年多）；相册新增两张照片 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 物品系统：{/color} 增加更多物品，购物加入购物车，更清楚地掌握购买内容和信息 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新场景：{/color} 在第一天晚间庆祝结束后，每天20:00可以给 {image=icon_wmom} 按摩。目前只有两张图，后续还会增加 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 辅导系统：{/color} 辅导小游戏回归，信息更清楚，平衡更好 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 窗口主题：{/color} 可在设置里修改菜单与对话窗口的主题 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 角色配色：{/color} {image=icon_wpre} 更换了配色 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 防止报错：{/color} 为避免低性能设备崩溃，移除可视地图；礼堂对白中过于吃性能的文字特效也已移除 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 音频设置不再隐藏对话提示音\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.22.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 主菜单界面：{/color} 社交媒体文字按钮改为图标按钮 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 近似问题修复：{/color} 更新了 {image=icon_wpre}的图标已更新。如果之前在杂货店认识她，第二天就能认出来，初遇获得额外好感；场景结束时买毛绒玩具，也会触发好感反应 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 更新移动端对话框； {image=icon_wpre}在杂货店事件中以“店员”显示名字；无限金钱不再造成购物无限循环； {image=icon_wmom}的无限烹饪消遣也已修复"

