    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.21.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} BGM Rework:{/color} the soundtrack was completely reworked with new and updated musics to make your immersion the best possible! There are 19 songs now, and you can listen to all of them in the 📱 Player Menu {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Locks & Schedules:{/color} it's hard to know if your bathroom is occupied, so lock the door if you don't want to be interrupted in the shower. {image=icon_wsis} showers at 07:00 in the morning, 14:00 on weekdays and 17:20 on weekends, and 😇🙏 be careful not to walk in on her, because she leaves the door open when her lust is above 50%. On Saturdays {image=icon_wnei} spends the day at your house, leaves the bedroom door unlocked when she goes to the bathroom, and showers and sleeps with {image=icon_wsis} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Art Rework:{/color} swimming accidents have a more ecchi view, and solo swimming got updated art {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Time Passing:{/color} a button to pass only 10 min gives you more control when skipping time {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Edit Data:{/color} responding to requests, you can now change {image=icon_wric}'s last name in the 📱 Player Menu. {image=icon_wsuk} and future interactable characters were added to the naming list too {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Persistent Data Reset:{/color} yeah, sorry. 🤷 New Year, new data! 🙋 It should avoid bugs caused by outdated data stored on your device, and prepares your settings for the new main menu {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Scenes Removed:{/color} the grocery store scene and the tutoring minigame are temporarily out, and should come back reworked with more interesting mechanics {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translation:{/color} French is up to date! Thanks to our translator Jin ❤ {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} {image=icon_wsis}'s hand movements in the H animation are fixed, no more error in {image=icon_wota}'s dialogue, and {image=icon_wsuk} no longer reappears in a loop right after being rejected"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.21.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 背景音乐重制：{/color} 全面重制配乐，加入新曲与更新曲目，尽量营造最佳沉浸感！目前共有19首，可在📱玩家菜单中全部收听 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 门锁与日程：{/color} 很难知道浴室有没有人；不想洗澡时被打扰，就把门锁上。 {image=icon_wsis} 每天07:00、工作日14:00、周末17:20会洗澡。😇🙏欲望高于50%时，她会开着门，进去时可得小心。周六， {image=icon_wnei} 会整天待在你家；去浴室时不锁卧室门，还会和 {image=icon_wsis} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 插画重制：{/color} 一起洗澡、睡觉。游泳意外的画面更有福利感，独自游泳也更新了插画 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 时间流逝：{/color} 新增只跳过10分钟的按钮，更精细地控制时间 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 数据编辑：{/color} 应玩家要求，现在可在📱玩家菜单修改 {image=icon_wric}的姓氏。 {image=icon_wsuk} 以及以后可互动的角色，也加入命名列表 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 持久数据重置：{/color} 是的，抱歉。🤷新年，新数据！🙋这能避免设备中旧数据引发的问题，并为新主菜单准备设置 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 暂时移除的场景：{/color} 杂货店场景与辅导小游戏暂时移除，之后会以更有趣的机制回归 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译：{/color} 法语已更新到最新！感谢译者Jin❤ {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} {image=icon_wsis}的成人动画手部动作已修复； {image=icon_wota}的对白不再报错； {image=icon_wsuk} 被拒绝后，不会马上又循环出现"

