    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.20.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Scene & Character:{/color} {image=icon_wric} becomes interactable after you complete her meeting scene, {b}School Princess{/b}. Some of her data and interaction content is still missing {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Socialization:{/color} hang out with characters during classes or class breaks to increase intimacy, love or lust with them, and swim with {image=icon_wnei} in the afternoon {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Reworked H Ending:{/color} the scenes after {image=icon_wsuk}'s H minigame are more visually dynamic, with different art depending on your performance {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Updated Scenes:{/color} new art for the bedroom trainings, the gameplay and dinner at the first day's night celebration, and the tutoring at the library {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Infinite Perks:{/color} the cheat code now has an infinite perk option {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Reworked BGM:{/color} updated some musics using the new Suno model {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translation:{/color} updated Chinese {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} {image=icon_wnei} no longer leaves without saying goodbye, and no more error when you tell {image=icon_wsuk} you're not in the mood\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.20.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Main Menu:{/color} Christmas themed main menu {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translation:{/color} Portuguese and Spanish are mostly up to date {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} socializing at swimming class no longer enters an infinite loop, and there's an attempt to fix the loading of old saves on android"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.20.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新场景与角色：{/color} {image=icon_wric} 完成初遇场景 {b}校园公主{/b}后，她即可互动。部分资料与互动内容仍待补齐 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 社交：{/color} 上课或课间与角色一起消遣，可提升亲密度、好感度或欲望；下午还可以与 {image=icon_wnei} 一起游泳 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 成人场景结尾重制：{/color} 以下角色的成人小游戏结束场景 {image=icon_wsuk}更有动态感，插画会根据表现变化 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 场景更新：{/color} 为卧室训练、第一天晚间庆祝中的游戏与晚餐，以及图书馆辅导加入新插画 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 无限天赋：{/color} 作弊码现提供无限天赋选项 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 背景音乐重制：{/color} 使用新版Suno模型更新部分音乐 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译：{/color} 更新中文翻译 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} {image=icon_wnei} 不会再不告而别；告诉 {image=icon_wsuk} 自己现在没心情时，也不再报错\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.20.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 主菜单：{/color} 圣诞主题主菜单 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译：{/color} 葡萄牙语和西班牙语基本更新到最新 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 游泳课社交不再陷入无限循环，并尝试修复安卓读取旧存档的问题"

