    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.19.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Optimization:{/color} the game got much lighter, going from about 665 MB to about 282 MB {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Character Content Update:{/color} {image=icon_wnei}'s content list was updated. Watching TV with her became {b}Cartoons Aint Borin'{/b}, with new outfits, a new background and a new gallery image, her school uniforms appear during headpats, you can meet her father in the {b}Appropriate Goodbye{/b} scene, and a new scene, {b}Copy & Paste DNA{/b}, was added {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Minigame:{/color} {b}Tug Of War{/b}. Play it by trying to impress {image=icon_wnei}'s father in the {b}Appropriate Goodbye{/b} scene {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Map:{/color} a city map is now available for fast travel, for a better visual experience {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Background Rework:{/color} the office backgrounds were updated to Blender renders {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} H Content Update:{/color} added a little more physics to the sex scene, for the immersion of a much tighter fit {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translation:{/color} Portuguese and Spanish are up to date {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} no more error on the school friend calculation at the end of the {b}Day 2: City Life{/b} quest, and removed the old light effects that left the game ugly on the map after some scenes\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.19.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Rebalanced Point:{/color} you gain XP from making {image=icon_wcou} cum, and the XP from {image=icon_wsuk} is shown on screen at the end of the minigame {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} updated the description of {image=icon_wmom}'s yoga guide, no more error in {image=icon_wdis}' dialogue when asking about her, and no more error opening the phone gallery from an older save"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.19.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 优化：{/color} 游戏大幅瘦身，体积从约665 MB降至约282 MB {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 角色内容更新：{/color} {image=icon_wnei}的内容列表更新。与她看电视的内容更名为 {b}动画片才不无聊{/b}，加入新服装、新背景和一张相册图片；摸头时可显示校服；还能在 {b}好好道别{/b} 场景遇到她父亲，并新增场景 {b}复制粘贴的基因{/b}。 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新小游戏：{/color} {b}拔河{/b}。在 {image=icon_wnei}的父亲面前尝试表现自己，即可在 {b}好好道别{/b} 场景中缺失的衣服 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 地图：{/color} 新增快速移动的城市地图，提供更好的视觉体验 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 背景重制：{/color} 诊所背景替换为Blender渲染画面 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 成人内容更新：{/color} 性爱场景增加一点物理效果，营造更紧密贴合的沉浸感 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译：{/color} 葡萄牙语和西班牙语已更新到最新 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 修复任务 {b}第二天：城市生活{/b} 结束时计算校园朋友数量的报错，并移除部分场景后让地图变难看的旧光照效果\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.19.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 点数平衡：{/color} 让 {image=icon_wcou} 高潮可获得经验； {image=icon_wsuk} 的小游戏经验会在结束时显示 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 更新了 {image=icon_wmom}的瑜伽指引描述；询问 {image=icon_wdis}相关对话不再报错，从旧存档打开手机相册也不再出错"

