    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.13.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Interaction Rework:{/color} character interaction is now divided into chat, touch, hang out and give item, and each character reacts differently to each of them depending on her personality. For now it's only available for {image=icon_wnei} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Character Memory:{/color} characters store information about you and may react differently depending on what they know. Later they may exchange gossip about you, so lying could cost you. For now it's only available for {image=icon_wnei} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Rhythm Minigame:{/color} dance as a hang out activity. It raises love based on your score and intimacy based on the music length. The button speed is still unstable, so choose the music option that fits your system best. For now it's only available for {image=icon_wnei} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Money and Item:{/color} earn money by helping students study at the library in the afternoon, with more than 10 intelligence points, then spend it on items to use or give as gifts {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Hygiene and Energy:{/color} energy drops slowly over time and recovers from items and activities, and hygiene drops with physical effort. Showering raises your intelligence and charisma, and the idea is that the bath can trigger erotic scenes {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Stat Points Rework:{/color} charisma is now gained by interacting with characters, mainly talking and touching, and training only adds a bonus on top. Bonuses are unlimited but decay a little at the end of each day {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Interface Rework:{/color} the buttons are more prominent, colorful and bigger, so you know what's a button and can click it easily on mobile {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} part 2 of {image=icon_wsis}' quest no longer gets stuck forever. You can do part 1 as many times as you want, and part 2 will be there the following day"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.13.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 互动重制：{/color} 角色互动分为聊天、触碰、消遣和送礼，各角色会根据性格作出不同反应。目前仅适用于 {image=icon_wnei} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 角色记忆：{/color} 角色会记住你的信息，并据此改变反应。以后可能互相传你的八卦，所以撒谎可能要付代价。目前仅适用于 {image=icon_wnei} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 节奏小游戏：{/color} 舞蹈可作为消遣活动，按得分增加好感，按音乐时长增加亲密度。按钮速度仍不稳定，请选最适合设备的音乐选项。目前仅适用于 {image=icon_wnei} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 金钱与物品：{/color} 智力超过10点后，下午可在图书馆辅导学生赚钱，再购买物品自用或送礼 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 卫生与精力：{/color} 精力随时间缓慢降低，通过物品或活动恢复；卫生随体力消耗下降。洗澡增加智力和魅力，也计划用于触发情色场景 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 属性重制：{/color} 魅力改为通过互动，主要是聊天与触碰获得；训练仅提供额外加成。加成没有上限，但每天结束会略微衰减 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 界面重制：{/color} 按钮更突出、鲜艳，也更大，方便识别，并适合手机点击 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 以下角色的任务第二部分 {image=icon_wsis}不再无限卡住。第一部分可以任意重复，第二部分会在次日出现"

