    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.12.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Pseudo-Anime Opening:{/color} yay! Now we have an opening! You can disable it in the settings if you find it annoying when opening the game xD {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Parallax Main Menu:{/color} it moves with your mouse or finger. Some layers didn't work well on my phone, so you can disable it in the settings if you don't want it :p {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Scene:{/color} talk to {image=icon_wgal} during your class to know her a little more and unlock her as an interactable character {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Referenced Character System:{/color} love, lust and intimacy now have bonuses you earn during scenes, usually when commenting on someone who isn't there. They have no limit but shrink every day. The girls' crush counters for your rival are part of this system now, so manage your influence on people wisely {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Naming System Rework:{/color} you can generate specific types of names, and the game prevents two characters from having the same one. Surnames can still be repeated for family {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Quest Reorganization:{/color} unknown characters aren't available at first. Check the content info in the character menu to know how to unlock them {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Audio Rework:{/color} some musics were added and others replaced, and the audio channels were reorganized so you can set the volume of environment, effects and voices separately {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Interface Rework:{/color} the menu buttons are larger and organized vertically on the right {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} the dialogue window no longer opens when it should be hidden, the dialogue beeps no longer repeat when the settings menu opens, and the Player Menu screens no longer stay on screen after you close it"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.12.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 动漫风片头：{/color} 好耶！有片头啦！每次开游戏觉得烦，也可以在设置里关闭，哈哈 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 视差主菜单：{/color} 随鼠标或手指移动。我手机上有些图层表现不好，不喜欢可以在设置里关掉 :p {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新场景：{/color} 上课时与 {image=icon_wgal} 交谈，进一步认识并解锁她的互动 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 角色提及系统：{/color} 场景中可以获得好感、欲望和亲密度加成，通常来自评论不在场的人。加成无上限，但每天会缩减。女生对情敌的倾心计数也并入这个系统，要明智地影响他人 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 命名系统重制：{/color} 可以生成特定类型的名字，系统会避免角色重名；家人仍可使用同姓 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 任务整理：{/color} 不认识的角色初始不可互动；查看角色菜单的内容信息，了解解锁方法 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 音频重制：{/color} 新增、替换部分乐曲，整理音频声道，环境音、音效与声音可分别调音量 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 界面重制：{/color} 菜单按钮加大，并在右侧纵向排列 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 对话框不再在应隐藏时弹出；打开设置时，对话提示音不再重复；关闭玩家菜单后，其子界面也不会残留"

