    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.11.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Scene:{/color} talk to {image=icon_wdis} in the school hallway, know her a little more, and influence her mind about her crush {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Updated Scene + New Minigame:{/color} join {image=icon_wmom} in her yoga workout on Sunday afternoon and help her improve her flexibility {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Reworked H Minigame:{/color} your PHY stats greatly increase your performance in H-Scenes. Go to the doctor's office at the end of Day 2 if you want to check it {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Rival System:{/color} the girls have a crush counter for {image=icon_hriv}, and you can influence how interested in him they feel. For now only the counter exists. The idea is that each passing day some girls become more or less interested in him, and that you can bend the course of events however you want, if you can {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Guide Menu:{/color} the game info now lives in a guide menu. Check it to know about the mechanics, minigames and general info {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Language:{/color} the game is now available in Spanish!\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.11.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Oops:{/color} fixed some missing characters in the Patreon supporters names xD"
