    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.9.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Scene:{/color} accompany {image=icon_wnei} to her house and have a good moment with her {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Scene:{/color} take care of {image=icon_wsis} after she ate too much at night {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Replayable Scenes:{/color} both new scenes can be done more than once and reached in two ways, and {image=icon_wsis}' waking up scene is repeatable too. Check the content list to know about {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Reworked Sprites:{/color} almost every girl was redrawn with a symmetrical upper body, and there are 5 breast sizes now. The small ones are even smaller, the huge ones are even huger {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Reworked Background:{/color} the home backgrounds became 3D renders, like the school ones {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Reworked Content List:{/color} the character content list is more detailed, with the info you need to play each scene {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translation:{/color} you can choose some languages in the main menu and it may translate parts of the game\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.9.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Fight Minigame:{/color} the fight minigame needs only 1 button during click time instead of 4, but the click time is faster {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Translation:{/color} Brazilian Portuguese is complete for the scenes {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} {image=icon_wsis} no longer keeps talking after she leaves, and {image=icon_hero}'s early morning dialogue about her no longer happens when the scene isn't available"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.9.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新场景：{/color} 陪 {image=icon_wnei} 回家，和她共度美好时光 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新场景：{/color} 在 {image=icon_wsis} 晚上吃撑后照顾她 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 可重复场景：{/color} 两个新场景都可重复体验，各有两种进入方式； {image=icon_wsis}的起床场景也可重复，详情请查看内容列表 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 立绘重制：{/color} 几乎所有女生都重绘为对称上半身；胸型现有五种尺寸，小的更小，大的更大 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 背景重制：{/color} 家庭背景和学校一样，改为三维渲染 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 内容列表重制：{/color} 角色内容列表更详细，提供游玩每个场景所需的信息 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译：{/color} 可在主菜单选择部分语言，翻译游戏中的一部分内容\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.9.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 战斗小游戏：{/color} 战斗点击阶段从四个按钮简化为一个，但点击节奏更快 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 翻译：{/color} 巴西葡萄牙语已完成场景翻译 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} {image=icon_wsis} 离开后不会继续说话； {image=icon_hero}清晨谈论她的对白，不会再在场景未开放时触发"

