    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.7.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Character Creator:{/color} names, forms of treatment, personalities and stats moved into an interactive character sheet menu, where you can choose everything more organized, or randomize it and go straight to the game. Click New Game to see the changes {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Scenes + Fight System:{/color} a fight is about to happen in the Men Locker Room. Will you deal with it using charisma, intelligence, or just fight? You're free to choose, as long as you don't forget the medical appointment you have at night {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Interactive Characters:{/color} the characters from the last update are now available for a beta interaction {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Stat Leveling:{/color} you can finally level up! {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Pseudo-Energy System:{/color} an energy bar was added to the stats, showing whether training is available {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Pseudo-Map:{/color} switch between the house, school and office. For now it's just a teleport, with no time cost {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Database Show:{/color} the phone contacts were removed, and the character info moved to the heart menu icon {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Writing Rework:{/color} several lines were corrected or redone with the help of proofreaders. If you think it got better, thank them, cos you know how my English is (>w<) {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Step-Cousin Appearance:{/color} {image=icon_wcou} has hazel eyes now. Yes, a change of such importance could not be out of the changelog"
