    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.6.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Characters:{/color} you're in a school now, and there's a lot of people there. Yes... A lot of them! {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Scene:{/color} continuation of the first day at school. Get to know the new characters and their relationships with each other {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Sprite Rework:{/color} the characters have a new head and face model, less wide, with different nose shapes, to look cuter, more expressive and more unique {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Affordable Student List:{/color} edit and check the new students names {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} changing your name on the phone no longer removes the quick menu buttons\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.6.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Cleanup:{/color} removed the minigame prototype that loaded instead of the save file, just to avoid confusing people with a displaced content '-'"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.6.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新角色：{/color} 现在来到学校，当然会有很多人。没错……很多很多！ {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新场景：{/color} 继续学校第一天的剧情，认识新角色和她们之间的关系 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 立绘重制：{/color} 角色使用新头脸模型，宽度收窄，鼻型不同，显得更可爱、更有表情和个性 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 可编辑学生名单：{/color} 编辑、查看新学生的名字 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 在手机修改自己的名字，不再导致快捷菜单按钮消失\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.6.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 清理：{/color} 移除原本会替代存档加载的小游戏原型，免得错位的内容让人困惑 '-'"

    # game/options.rpy:50
    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.5.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Character and Scenes:{/color} your school days started, and now you have a new place to explore, with new scenes to live and a new character to meet {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Week System:{/color} the days of the week are counted now, and the characters routines follow them {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Turn ON/OFF Text Effects:{/color} choose whether the animated dialogue texts appear, so you can have the best experience without any crashes {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Dialogue Improvement:{/color} more colorful text for laughs, names and thoughts, and each character has a more personal voice and way of speaking {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Gallery Improvement:{/color} pass through the images, hide or show the buttons, set an image as your phone wallpaper, and check the artists info {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Anatomy Rework:{/color} the characters heads no longer grow in the same proportion as their bodies. The taller they are, the smaller their heads look {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Music Rework:{/color} known musics were remixed and new ones were added {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Rebalanced Affection:{/color} lust rises much faster but also drops considerably each day, and {image=icon_wsis}' affection depends less on your personality and more on her love for you"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.5.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新角色与场景：{/color} 校园生活开始，可以探索新地点、体验新场景，并认识新角色 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 星期系统：{/color} 开始计算星期，角色日程也会随之安排 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 开关文字特效：{/color} 可选择是否显示动态对白文字，兼顾体验，避免崩溃 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 对话改善：{/color} 笑声、名字与心声使用更丰富的颜色，每个角色的声音与说话方式也更有个性 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 相册改善：{/color} 可切换图片、隐藏或显示按钮、设为手机壁纸，并查看画师信息 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 体型重制：{/color} 角色头部不再和身体等比例放大，身高越高，头部比例越小 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 音乐重制：{/color} 重新混音已有音乐，并加入新曲 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 感情平衡：{/color} 欲望增长快得多，但每天也会明显下降； {image=icon_wsis}的感情对你性格的依赖降低，更看重她对你的好感"

    # game/options.rpy:50
    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.4.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Characters:{/color} {image=icon_wcou} and {image=icon_wgma} join the game {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Scenes:{/color} start a video call to witness very fun moments with the family {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Phone Buttons:{/color} added {b}Settings{/b} and {b}Discord{/b} buttons to the phone, and the cheat options now appear in the settings screen instead of a new one {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Reworked Night Effect:{/color} added a light effect to simulate artificial lighting at night"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.4.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新角色：{/color} {image=icon_wcou} 和 {image=icon_wgma} 加入游戏 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新场景：{/color} 发起视频通话，见证家人们的欢乐时刻 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新手机按钮：{/color} 为手机加入 {b}设置{/b} 和 {b}Discord{/b} 按钮；作弊选项不再单开界面，改为显示在设置里 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 夜间效果重制：{/color} 加入模拟夜间人工照明的光效"

    # game/options.rpy:50
    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.3.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Scene:{/color} ask {image=icon_wsis} to go to the Grocery Store with you, then {image=icon_wmom} will show you something very nice... {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Scene:{/color} hang out in the park with {image=icon_wsis}... if you can! (Love required: 5) {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Flowing Time:{/color} no more getting stuck in the early afternoon for lack of content. You can advance time when interacting with the girls. Who would you like to spend more time with? {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Gallery:{/color} view the photos saved on your phone {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Dialogue Mode:{/color} switch between Immersive and Practical in the Preferences. Immersive is the most natural and expressive experience, Practical is the best if you're not comfortable with text pauses or beep sounds {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Text Effects:{/color} some texts are now animated, and some spelling errors were fixed {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Rebalanced Points:{/color} no more starting rich and full of stat points. Your charisma and personality are much more relevant to the girls affection now {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Clearer Ending:{/color} the game returns to the main menu when the content ends, instead of leaving you exploring. Load a save or start a new game to try other possibilities {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Improved Notifications:{/color} the pop-up messages are more fluid and no longer get stuck\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.3.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} the cheat code no longer crashes the game\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.3.2 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Item Sprites:{/color} items now appear in the characters hands {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Gallery Bonus Photos:{/color} check the Kawaii Character Creator information and get a code to unlock 2 bonus photos for your phone gallery"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.3.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新场景：{/color} 随时可以请求 {image=icon_wsis} 陪你去杂货店，之后 {image=icon_wmom} 会让你看点很棒的东西…… {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新场景：{/color} 与 {image=icon_wsis}在公园一起玩……前提是你做得到！（好感要求：5） {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 流动时间：{/color} 不再因内容不足卡在午后，和女生互动即可推进时间。你想多陪谁一会儿呢？ {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 相册：{/color} 查看保存在手机里的照片 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 对话模式：{/color} 可在偏好设置中切换沉浸或实用模式。沉浸模式最自然、最有表现力；不喜欢文字停顿与提示音时，可选择实用模式 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 文字特效：{/color} 部分文字加入动画，并修复一些拼写错误 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 点数平衡：{/color} 不再一开局就很有钱、属性全满；魅力和性格现在更影响女生的感情 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 更明确的结尾：{/color} 内容结束后返回主菜单，不再让你继续探索；读取存档或新开游戏，体验其他可能 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 提示改善：{/color} 弹出消息更流畅，不再卡住\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.3.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 作弊码不再导致游戏崩溃\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.3.2 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 物品立绘：{/color} 物品现在会出现在角色手中 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 相册额外照片：{/color} 查看Kawaii Character Creator的信息，获取代码，解锁手机相册的两张额外照片"

    # game/options.rpy:50
    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.2.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Scene:{/color} watching TV {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} New Art:{/color} more colorful and handdrawed artwork {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Animated Sprites:{/color} the characters blink, open their mouths to speak, and change expression with their mood and personality {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Time, Location & Routine:{/color} time passes as you do things, and the girls location is checked by the hour {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Follower System:{/color} a girl can follow you and stay wherever you move, adding new interactions to your scenes. For now only {image=icon_wnei} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Upset System:{/color} the girls can get upset with you and avoid chatting until they forgive or forget. Find ways to apologize to shorten it {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Affection Points:{/color} the girls gain intimacy, love and lust as you interact with them, at a rate that depends on your personality and how well it matches hers {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} UI:{/color} cleaner, but with much more options and info. Unlock the girls numbers to access their information, and see pop-up messages with your points {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Cheat Code:{/color} insert the right code to unlock the cheats, available for Patreon supporters {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Bug Fix:{/color} the variables no longer reset on game reload"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.2.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新场景：{/color} 看电视 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 新插画：{/color} 更多鲜艳的手绘插画 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 动态立绘：{/color} 角色会眨眼、张嘴说话，并根据心情和性格改变表情 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 时间、地点与日程：{/color} 做事会消耗时间，按小时检查女生的位置 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 跟随系统：{/color} 女生可以跟随你移动，待在你去的地方，为场景加入新互动。目前只有 {image=icon_wnei} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 生气系统：{/color} 女生可能对你生气，在原谅或忘记前不愿聊天。设法道歉，可缩短生气时间 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 感情点数：{/color} 与女生互动可增加亲密度、好感度和欲望；增长速度取决于你的性格，以及和她是否合得来 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 界面：{/color} 更简洁，却有更多选项与信息。解锁女生号码，即可查看资料；获得点数时会弹出消息 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 作弊码：{/color} 输入正确代码即可解锁作弊，提供给Patreon支持者 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 问题修复：{/color} 重新加载游戏不再重置变量"

    # game/options.rpy:50
    old "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.1.0 - Major Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Reworked:{/color} the game is 2D now, and planned to have an RPG-sandbox gameplay. WelCUM To The City is a visual novel where you upgrade your character skills and your decisions affect the world around you. The intention is that it isn't one more linear story game where you just keep clicking and doing repetitive things again and again {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Intro:{/color} an interactive and short prologue where you choose your first traits and meet the other characters {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Naming:{/color} name every character freely, or generate their names if you don't wanna choose {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Stats & Skills:{/color} stat points for intelligence, physical condition and charisma, and skill points for guitar, massage and teaching {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Choices:{/color} the characters have preferences of traits, so you can't be the best to everyone. There's no right or wrong. Choices have consequences and it's up to you to decide what's best for you {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Sounds:{/color} cute sounds for the dialogues\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.1.1 - Minor Update{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} Extras:{/color} added info after the prologue, some scene effects, and changed the music"
    new "{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.1.0 - 大型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 重制：{/color} 游戏现改为二维画面，并计划采用角色扮演沙盒玩法。《欢欲都市》是一部可提升角色技能、并通过选择影响周围世界的视觉小说。希望它不只是又一款线性剧情游戏，让玩家一味点击、反复重复同样的事 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 序章：{/color} 简短而有互动的序章，可选择最初的特质，并认识其他角色 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 命名：{/color} 自由给每个角色命名；不想选，也可以自动生成 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 属性与技能：{/color} 属性点用于智力、体能和魅力，技能点用于吉他、按摩和教学 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 选择：{/color} 角色各有偏好的特质，不可能讨好所有人。没有绝对的对错，但选择会产生后果；什么最适合自己，由你决定 {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 声音：{/color} 可爱的对话提示音\n\n{p}{color=#FF325B}{b}0.1.1 - 小型更新{/b}{/color} {p}{p}{color=#FF325B}{image=starchan} 额外内容：{/color} 序章后增加信息、部分场景特效，并更换音乐"

